  "content": "<h1><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#ba372a\">SwordCraftOnline</span></strong></h1><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#ba372a\">禁止未經授權使用紋理與模型。</span></strong></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組靈感源自川原礫創作的《刀劍神域》動畫系列，旨在逐步於Minecraft中重現SAO世界觀。目前正持續添加內容，敬請耐心等候。</span></h3><h1><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">必要元件：</span></strong></span></h1><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/847/183/638246399784227999.png\" width=\"232\" height=\"232\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/195/772/636881112930494939.png\" width=\"237\" height=\"237\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/474/153/logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"425\" height=\"124\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080\">本模組使用MCreator製作</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080\"><img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69686547?s=200&amp;v=4\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\"></span></strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080\">特別感謝「<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/oscar10081/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oscar10081</a>」授權使用其<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sword-art-online\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">資源包</a>中的部分紋理。</span></strong></span></p>",
